=2 Walkthrough
\**{c=red:Note}**: You only need 20 signatures to progress in the mission; however, if you collect more, you can receive a prize as well. Prizes include items required for certain {p:inventory upgrade quests|Gobbiebag Quests} you might be interested in. __See Rewards section at the bottom of the page for more info.__
For this quest you will need to collect at least 20 signatures from the Knights in {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)}.
* If strictly interested in mission progression, use the image below for the fastest solution, following the **{c=turquoise:turquoise blue line}**:

!Wotg proof of valor 20 signatures speedrun.png||
=3 Dialogue - Total of 10 Signatures
{n:Aissaville} (I-7), {n:Illeuse} (H-9), {n:Daigraffeaux} (I-11), {n:Andagge} (H-9), {n:Louxiard} (G-7), {n:Machionage} (C-6), {n:Remiotte} (L-10), {n:Elnonde} (K-9), {n:Loillie} (K-9), and {n:Mailleronce} (M-6) will freely give you 1 signature each after talking to them.
=3 Question and Answer - Total of 24 Signatures
{n:Farouel} (K-7), {n:Aurfet} (G-9), {n:Corseihaut} (F-6), {n:Vichauxdat} (I-8) will ask you a series of questions about the war. The more questions you get right the more signatures they will gather for you, with a max of 6 each.
* {n:Farouel} (K-7), Answers:
** Smilodons
** Tauri
** Ghosts
* {n:Vichauxdat} (I-8) Answers:
** Three
** Gutrenders
** Grradhod
* {n:Aurfet} (G-9, upper level) Answers:
** Yrvaulair S Coussereaux
** Febrenard C Brunnaut
** Valaineral R Davilles
** Knights of the Rustwing Hawk
* {n:Corseihaut} (F-6) Answers:
** Uwe Prien
** Mythril Musketeers
** Klara Bester
** Robel Akbel
** Twelve
** Choh Moui

There does not appear to be a way to reset a questionnaire if you've received less than the full amount of signatures from that NPC, even with methods such as zoning. However, if you get all questions incorrect in a Q&A, they will decline to sign at all and you can repeat that quiz.
=3 Quests
* {n:Eumielle} (I-9) will give you 12 signatures for an {i:Angler's Cassoulet|Angler's Cassoulet|5704}.
** {i:Angler's Cassoulet|Angler's Cassoulet|5704} is obtained by completing {q:Beans Ahoy!|Beans Ahoy!|Beans Ahoy!}.
* {n:Coucheutand} (I-8) will ask for Orc equipment. An {p:Orcish Axe} gives you 5 signatures, {i:Orc Helm|Orc Helm|15200} will get you 10 signatures, and a {i:Gold Orcmask|Gold Orcmask|554} gets you 15 signatures.
* {n:Hauberliond} (H-9) will give you 9 signatures for a single stack of {p:Crossbow Bolts|Crossbow Bolt}. He gives a maximum of 12 signatures for 4 stacks of {p:Crossbow Bolts|Crossbow Bolt}. (2 or 3 stacks give 10 or 11 signatures, respectively.)
* {n:Sabiliont} (I-11) will give you 9 signatures for 3 stacks of {i:Gysahl Greens|Gysahl Greens|4545}. He will give you a maximum of 12 signatures for 8 stacks. (4-7 stacks gives 10 signatures.)
* {n:Rongelouts N Distaud} (I-9) will give you 35 signatures for {i:Gnole Claw|Gnole Claw|2521}. He will then challenge you to a game of Rock, Paper, Scissors. You must defeat him 3 times to get the signatures from him.
** If he uses /point, he will throw Volcanic Rock. (Use Nether Vellum to win.)
** If he uses /think, he will throw Scorpion Stinger. (Use Volcanic Rock to win.)
** If he uses /poke, he will throw Nether Vellum. (Use Scorpion Stinger to win.)

Once you have at least 20 signatures, return to {n:Raustigne} (I-7) and confirm your submission for a cutscene. (You may need to zone first.)
* If you choose to not turn in the current amount of signatures, or deny the confirmation, you will need to zone out and back to continue.

