=2 Rewards List
The reward depends on the number of signatures obtained. 120 is the highest amount of obtainable signatures.
* 20-29 signatures > No Reward
* 30-40 signatures > {i:Oxblood Orb|Oxblood Orb|2743}
* 41-80 signatures > {i:Foulard|Foulard|2705}
* 81-99 signatures > {i:Angel Skin Orb|Angel Skin Orb|2744}
* 100-119 signatures > {i:Orichalcum Ingot|Orichalcum Ingot|747}
* 120 signatures > {i:Molybdenum Ingot|Molybden. Ingot|1711}

